ഒന്നാം ഘട്ടത്തിലെ പരിശോധന.

Hamlet, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Juliet, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Romeo, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Othello, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Macbeth, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Lady Macbeth, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Ophelia, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Cordelia, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Desdemona, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Portia, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Viola, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Miranda, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Ariel, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Caliban, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Falstaff, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Rosalind, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Horatio, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Polonius, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Prospero, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.

Act I: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero: You are a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Juliet]
Prospero: You are a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Romeo]
Prospero: You are a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Othello]
Prospero: You are a big hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero: You are a big hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Horatio]
Prospero: You are a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Polonius]
Prospero: You are as good as the difference between a big big big big big big big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Horatio and Polonius]

Scene III: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
Horatio: Are you better than nothing?
Polonius:
 If not, let us proceed to scene IV.
Horatio: You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
Polonius:
 You are as good as the product of yourself and a big hero.
 Let us return to scene III.

Scene IV: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Horatio]
Prospero: You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene V: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Lady Macbeth]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of a big big big big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of the sum of a big big big big hero and a big big big hero and the sum of a big big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Cordelia]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of a big big big big big hero and the sum of a big big big hero and the sum of a big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Desdemona]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of a big big big big big big hero and the sum of a big big hero and the sum of a big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Portia]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of a big big big big big big hero and the sum of a big big big big big hero and the sum of a big big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Act II: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Viola]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the product of Lady Macbeth and Lady Macbeth.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the sum of a big hero and a hero and Ophelia.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big hero.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Horatio.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Miranda]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the product of Ophelia and Ophelia.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the sum of a big big hero and a hero and Cordelia.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Lady Macbeth.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Horatio.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene III: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Ariel]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the product of Cordelia and Cordelia.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the sum of the sum of a big big hero and a big hero and a hero and Desdemona.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Ophelia.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Horatio.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene IV: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Caliban]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the product of Desdemona and Desdemona.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the sum of the sum of a big big big hero and a big hero and a hero and Portia.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Cordelia.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Horatio.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene V: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Falstaff]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the product of Portia and Portia.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the sum of the sum of a big big big hero and a big big hero and a hero and Lady Macbeth.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Desdemona.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Horatio.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Act III: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Viola and Lady Macbeth]
Viola: You are as good as Viola.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Miranda and Ophelia]
Miranda: You are as good as Miranda.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Ariel and Cordelia]
Ariel: You are as good as Ariel.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Caliban and Desdemona]
Caliban: You are as good as Caliban.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Falstaff and Portia]
Falstaff: You are as good as Falstaff.
[Exeunt]

Act IV: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Rosalind]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the product of Lady Macbeth and Hamlet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of Ophelia and Juliet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of Cordelia and Romeo.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of Desdemona and Othello.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of Portia and Macbeth.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the sum of a big hero and a hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the sum of a big big hero and a hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big hero.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Horatio.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]

Act V: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Rosalind]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the product of Rosalind and Rosalind.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the sum of a big hero and a hero and Rosalind.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the sum of a big big hero and a hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the sum of the sum of a big big hero and a big hero and a hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the sum of the sum of a big big big hero and a big hero and a hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Lady Macbeth.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Horatio.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
